      "writtenOn": "2020-11-18T19:12:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The only way we can avoid specializing is to remove this check for all devices. The benefit of keeping it for non-GSI systems is that we can verify that vendor customized ::android::GetComponentRole resolves the android \u003d\u003e OMX roles the same way as their HAL.",
